%% CHT Platform: authentication flow (Cognito)

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User browser
  participant FE as React frontend
  participant API as NestJS backend
  participant CG as Cognito Hosted UI
  participant G as Google OAuth
  participant DB as Aurora PostgreSQL

  Note over U,DB: Email / password login
  U->>FE: Submit login form
  FE->>FE: reCAPTCHA v3 token (optional)
  FE->>API: POST /auth/cognito/login
  API->>CG: InitiateAuth USER_PASSWORD_AUTH
  CG-->>API: tokens or MFA challenge
  API->>DB: Session + User lookup
  API-->>FE: httpOnly session cookie

  Note over U,DB: Google sign-in / sign-up
  U->>FE: Continue with Google
  FE->>CG: OAuth authorize (PKCE)
  CG->>G: Federated login
  G-->>CG: IdP response
  CG-->>FE: auth code → /auth/callback
  FE->>API: POST /auth/cognito/callback
  API->>CG: Exchange code for tokens
  API->>DB: findOrCreateByCognitoSub
  API-->>FE: session cookie
